  {
   "section": "intro",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "The Learning Hub helps you get the most from instruments"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "When it comes to mass spectrometer training, we believe your go-to source should be the people that know the technology, applications, workflows and methods the best. That’s why SCIEX offers diverse and flexible learning options for expert-led training, with best-in-class content that helps you get the most out of your instrument and take your lab to the next level. And now, lab managers have the ability to manage SCIEX training for all of their staff through the Learning Manager."
    }
   ],
