    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Comprehensive"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Search self-paced online course catalog designed to help you build skills, deepen knowledge, and get the most out of your SCIEX instruments – anytime, anywhere."
    },
    {
