  {
   "section": "success-programs",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Earn a workflow certificate or receive fully personalized application support"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Learning Hub Success Programs offer a comprehensive training option, with personalized, blended online and in-person courses. Successful completion provides you with a workflow certificate. Each program is purposefully designed based on renowned spaced learning models that are proven to maximize your knowledge retention by up to 16-times."
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Learn more about our Success Programs",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/support/training/success-programs"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "Work with a SCIEX applications support specialist to create a training agenda just for you. There are a wide range of applications supported to build a program that is most suited to your lab users"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "Learn more about personalized application support",
     "href": "https://sciex.com/education/customer-site-training/personalized-application-support-at-customer-site"
    }
